        "tool_call_id": "agent_swap_70659d"
      },
      {
        "content": "Okay John — that agreement just went out to your phone and email. Pull it up while we're on and I'll walk you through the key points and answer anything you've got. In the meantime, I can start by walking you through the main aspects of it if you're ready. Just let me know.",
        "created_timestamp": 1792354121010,
        "message_id": "message_369917efc7a58b75e1ad9fcd",
        "metadata": {
          "response_id": 1
        },
        "role": "agent"
      },
      {
        "content": "Okay, sounds good.",
        "created_timestamp": 1792354121336,
        "message_id": "message_56953e8e9e82f1a1e459d216",
        "role": "user"
      },
      {
        "content": "The first piece is the buyback, called actual damages. That means the manufacturer takes the truck back and refunds what you paid toward it. That includes things like finance charges, sales tax, license fees, the initial registration fee if it’s on the contract, and other official fees tied to getting it.\n\nSecond, you never get a bill from us. The manufacturer pays the firm’s fees and costs, and the hourly rates in the agreement are there just so you can see how that gets calculated.\n\nThird, the only percentage in the agreement is on money above the buyback, what we call additional damages. For the sake of argument, if the buyback were fifty thousand and the case settled for a hundred thousand, the first fifty is all yours, our fees are paid separately by the manufacturer, and the extra fifty gets split fifty-fifty, so you’d walk away with seventy-five thousand.\n\nLast piece is the mileage offset. That’s a fixed deduction built into the lemon law based on the good miles driven before the problem first showed up. It applies to every buyback no matter who handles the case, and it doesn’t keep growing while the case is pending.\n\nThat’s the whole thing in a nutshell. What questions can I answer before I walk you through signing?",
        "created_timestamp": 1792354123415,
        "message_id": "message_e50d3ade507b3edc96f0d63f",
        "metadata": {
          "response_id": 2
        },
        "role": "agent"
      },
      {
        "content": "No questions, I'm good.",
